  "description": "Viewer component of the main DicomObjects.Net DICOM library.  A .NET MAUI backed library for CPU and GPU accelerated rendering with SkiaSharp to provide 2D and 3D viewing.\n      The API is user-friendly and is aimed to provide easy ways to build DICOM solution. This library is actively supported by MedicalConnections Ltd, UK. If you have any questions please contact our support team.",
