  "releaseNotes": "DicomWeb overhaul\nNew Overload for DicomWebClients (like qido/wado) that takes DicomWebClientConnectionConfig to allow user to define web settings.\nThe handler and httpclinet is created once per instance and reused for all web calls.\nAdded two overloads to DicomWeb.Listen that can take X509Certificate2 and Action<HttpsConnectionAdapterOptions> giving more control to user\nCaller controls the lifetime of the web client\nTLS 1.3 can now be used.",
